			"Message": "refactor(Wind): Normalize Unicode whitespace in Architecture documentation\n\nStandardize the use of Unicode whitespace characters (specifically the em space \\u2009) between section headers and icons in `Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md`. Ensure consistent spacing across all headers (Overview, Architecture, Module Map, etc.) to align with the project's strict documentation formatting conventions established in recent commits.\n\nThis cleanup resolves visual inconsistencies in the rendered GitHub README and maintains uniformity with other architectural documentation in the Wind service layer.",
