			],
			"Message": "docs(Wind): Standardize architecture documentation with unicode section icons and inline code\n\nRefactor the `Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md` file to align with the project's strict formatting conventions. Replace plain text references with backtick-wrapped inline code for all technical identifiers (e.g., `Wind`, `Mountain`, `Tauri`, `Effect-TS`). Add Unicode section icons (🍃, 📋, 🏗️, 🗺️, etc.) to headers for improved visual navigation in the GitHub README view.\n\nAdditionally, update the \"Related Documentation\" links to use absolute HTTPS URLs pointing to the `Current` branch on GitHub, ensuring external navigation reliability, and adjust table column widths for consistent alignment. These changes enhance the document's readability and ensure strict adherence to the documentation style guide.",
			"SHA": "d899f5598f8f33aa037ceca14686e0c0c9c24593"
